blem "![](images/fa/fa797de4c7edfb4e4c4bc4eab40e8443f832c0407f08fd9d9ae28730c468a71e.png)\n\nIn the quadrilateral $OMNP$ shown above, find $x.$"] ["question-8d216a5f-ca4b-530d-81c3-76f09a214af9" :question/worked-solution "A quadrilateral has $n=4$ sides. Therefore, the sum of the interior angles of a quadrilateral must be \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{180}^{∘}\\cdot (n-2) & ={180}^{∘}\\cdot (4-2) \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & ={360}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding up the internal angles and solving for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠O+m∠M+m∠N+m∠P & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ {93}^{∘}+(14x-{7}^{∘})+(11x-{2}^{∘})+{76}^{∘} & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ 25x+{160}^{∘} & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ 25x & ={200}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={8}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-8d216a5f-ca4b-530d-81c3-76f09a214af9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-172b1f55-032f-506f-a1f3-de37620daea9" :answer-field/id #uuid "172b1f55-032f-506f-a1f3-de37620daea9"] ["answer-8845496d-a3e1-5e36-8bf1-e36d44baa191" :answer/id #uuid "8845496d-a3e1-5e36-8bf1-e36d44baa191"] ["answer-8845496d-a3e1-5e36-8bf1-e36d44baa191" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8845496d-a3e1-5e36-8bf1-e36d44baa191" :answer/value "{10}^{∘}"] ["answer-78305b75-af32-5483-8ec7-da87251e1870" :answer/id #uuid "78305b75-af32-5483-8ec7-da87251e1870"] ["answer-78305b75-af32-5483-8ec7-da87251e1870" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-78305b75-af32-5483-8ec7-da87251e1870" :answer/value "{14}^{∘}"] ["answer-c14baac9-826a-5be1-a8d3-292463298b03" :answer/id #uuid "c14baac9-826a-5be1-a8d3-292463298b03"] ["answer-c14baac9-826a-5be1-a8d3-292463298b03" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c14baac9-826a-5be1-a8d3-292463298b03" :answer/value "{21}^{∘}"] ["answer-23ba891b-8c25-5525-b032-ab5b189de223" :answer/id #uuid "23ba891b-8c25-5525-b032-ab5b189de223"] ["answer-23ba891b-8c25-5525-b032-ab5b189de223" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-23ba891b-8c25-5525-b032-ab5b189de223" :answer/value "{3}^{∘}"] ["answer-779f08b8-d128-5006-babf-2a