 (n-2)=3\\,{960}^{∘}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve for $n,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{180}^{∘}\\cdot (n-2) & =3\\,{960}^{∘} \\\\ n-2 & =\\frac{3\\,{960}^{∘}}{{180}^{∘}} \\\\ n-2 & =22 \\\\ n & =24\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the polygon has $n=24$ sides."] ["question-918f9202-d934-535a-b14f-29131ec63f3f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-d8f0acf3-60c9-5fe9-a760-cefa37eb9b66" :answer-field/id #uuid "d8f0acf3-60c9-5fe9-a760-cefa37eb9b66"] ["answer-6f8c4f4d-a7cb-5f36-ba29-a840d9bbe587" :answer/id #uuid "6f8c4f4d-a7cb-5f36-ba29-a840d9bbe587"] ["answer-6f8c4f4d-a7cb-5f36-ba29-a840d9bbe587" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6f8c4f4d-a7cb-5f36-ba29-a840d9bbe587" :answer/value "21"] ["answer-ef70b68e-e007-52ca-93c9-efe7e0c22ece" :answer/id #uuid "ef70b68e-e007-52ca-93c9-efe7e0c22ece"] ["answer-ef70b68e-e007-52ca-93c9-efe7e0c22ece" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ef70b68e-e007-52ca-93c9-efe7e0c22ece" :answer/value "23"] ["answer-ca5c0925-8ebb-5ac7-b69a-43148347d1bf" :answer/id #uuid "ca5c0925-8ebb-5ac7-b69a-43148347d1bf"] ["answer-ca5c0925-8ebb-5ac7-b69a-43148347d1bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ca5c0925-8ebb-5ac7-b69a-43148347d1bf" :answer/value "24"] ["answer-f4c3f901-4de5-5726-95e7-07fe74a05efc" :answer/id #uuid "f4c3f901-4de5-5726-95e7-07fe74a05efc"] ["answer-f4c3f901-4de5-5726-95e7-07fe74a05efc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f4c3f901-4de5-5726-95e7-07fe74a05efc" :answer/value "26"] ["answer-ae31482c-97e7-5e10-8bf9-1fb019613501" :answer/id #uuid "ae31482c-97e7-5e10-8bf9-1fb019613501"] ["answer-ae31482c-97e7-5e10-8bf9-1fb019613501" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ae31482c-97e7-5e10-8bf9-1fb019613501" :answer/value "29"] ["answer-field-d8f0acf3-60c9-5fe9-a760-cefa37eb9b66" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-d8f0acf3-60c9-5fe9-a760-cefa37eb9b66" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-d8f0acf3-60c9-5fe9-a760-cefa37eb9b66" :answer-field/correct "answer-ca5c09